        <description><![CDATA[This virtual machine template lets you quickly spin up an Ubuntu Server 18.04 LTS virtual machine in Microsoft Azure. The template includes all the necessary configuration options and resources to deploy the virtual machine, including the virtual network, subnet, network security group, and storage account.
Some key features of this VM template include:
- Ubuntu Server 18.04 LTS operating system
- 1 vCPUs and 1 GB RAM
- 30 GB managed OS disk
- Public IP address with dynamic allocation
- SSH public key authentication enabled
- Network security group with default rules for SSH and 
  HTTP traffic

You can modify this template according to your needs &#x1f642;.

Note: 
You must change the value of the publickey input variable to your own public key.]]></description>
